#: koha-tmpl/opac-tmpl/bootstrap/en/modules/ilsdi.tt:249
#, c-format
msgid "Given a list of record identifiers, returns a list of record objects that contain bibliographic information, as well as associated holdings and item information. The caller may request a specific metadata schema for the record objects to be returned. This function behaves similarly to HarvestBibliographicRecords and HarvestExpandedRecords in Data Aggregation, but allows quick, real time lookup by bibliographic identifier."
msgstr "Berilgan yozuv identifikatorlari ro‘yxati asosida bibliografik ma’lumotlar, shuningdek ularga tegishli fond (holdings) va nusxa (item) ma’lumotlarini o‘z ichiga olgan yozuv obyektlari ro‘yxatini qaytaradi. Foydalanuvchi (so‘rov yuboruvchi) qaytariladigan yozuv obyektlari uchun ma’lum bir metadata sxemasini tanlashi mumkin. Ushbu funksiya Data Aggregation bo‘limidagi HarvestBibliographicRecords va HarvestExpandedRecords funksiyalariga o‘xshash ishlaydi, biroq bibliografik identifikator bo‘yicha tezkor va real vaqt rejimidagi qidiruvni ta’minlaydi."

#: koha-tmpl/opac-tmpl/bootstrap/en/modules/ilsdi.tt:253
#, c-format
msgid "You can use OAI-PMH ListRecords instead of this service."
msgstr "Ushbu xizmat o‘rniga OAI-PMH ListRecords’dan foydalanishingiz mumkin."

